{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"Atiyah–Singer 指标定理"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Atiyah--Singer指标定理"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>Atiyah–Singer 指标定理在流形上整体地描述微分方程的拓扑.</p>\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"椭圆算子","text":"椭圆算子"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"拓扑指标","text":"拓扑指标"}},{"Plain":"等于"},{"Local":{"url":"解析指标","text":"解析指标"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Nicolaescu, Notes on the Atiyah-Singer Index Theorem</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>设 $E$ 为 Dirac 丛, $D$ 为 Dirac 算子, $F^{E/\\mathbb S}\\in \\operatorname{End}_{\\mathrm{Cl}(M)}(E)$ 为曲率 (twisting curvature), 定义"},{"Local":{"url":"陈特征","text":"陈特征"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{ch}^{E/\\mathbb S}:= \\operatorname{str}^{E/\\mathbb S} \\exp\\left(\\frac{i}{2\\pi} F^{E/\\mathbb S}\\right) \\in\\Omega^\\bullet(M),\r\n$$\n"},{"Local":{"url":"A-hat类","text":"A-hat 类"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\widehat{A}(M)=\\det \\left(\\frac{\\frac{i}{4\\pi}R}{\\sinh (\\frac{i}{4\\pi}R)}\\right)^{1/2},\r\n$$\n那么 Atiyah–Singer 定理是说\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{ind}D=\\dim\\ker D -\\dim\\ker D^* =\\int_M \\widehat{A}(M) \\operatorname{ch}^{E/\\mathbb S}(E).\r\n$$</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>John W. Morgan, The Seiberg–Witten Equations and Applications …, 3.3 节</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>设 $X$ 为闭可定向 Riemann 四维流形, $\\widetilde P$ 是 $X$ 上的自旋结构, $\\partial \\hspace{-5pt}/$ 为复旋量丛 $S_{\\mathbb{C}}^+(\\widetilde P)$ 到 $S_{\\mathbb{C}}^-(\\widetilde P)$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Dirac算子","text":"Dirac 算子"}},{"Plain":", 由其"},{"Local":{"url":"象征","text":"象征"}},{"Plain":"可计算其"},{"Local":{"url":"解析指标","text":"解析指标"}},{"Plain":"如下.</p>\n<p>回忆对于 $\\pi\\colon T^*X\\to X$, 象征是 $T^*X$ 上的向量丛 $\\pi^* S^+$ 到 $\\pi^* S^-$ 的丛同态. 这个丛同态在 $T^*X\\setminus X$ (减去零截面) 上的限制是丛的同构. 因此, 象征给出了 $T^*X$ 相对于 $T^*X\\setminus X$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"相对K-群","text":"相对 K-群 (拓扑)"}},{"Plain":"的一个元素. Atiyah–Singer 指标定理即是说, 由这个相对 K-理论的元素可计算出解析指标.</p>\n"}]}}